<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.10">
<l>aravat tamaḷiyi ṉōṭu maḻakiya pāṟkaṭa lōṭu</l>
<l>maravintap pāvaiyun tāṉu makampaṭi vantupu kuntu</l>
<l>paravait tiraipala mōtap paḷḷikoḷ kiṉṟapi rāṉai</l>
<l>paravu kiṉṟāṉviṭ ṭucittaṉ paṭṭiṉaṅ kāvaṟ poruṭṭē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Viṭṭucittaṉ praises the Lord who sleeps</l>
<l rend="indent">while many waves crash in the expanse</l>
<l>on [His] serpent bed in the beautiful milk ocean,</l>
<l rend="indent">the Lotus Lady having come and entered [His] heart,</l>
<l>because [He] is the protection of [this] maritime town.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
